<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuela is confronting severe power outages, with more than half of the population experiencing near-daily blackouts, fueling protests over the power crisis. The government has opened the power sector to private investment, allowing firms such as Fluor to consider returning after two decades. Ecopetrol is negotiating a ten-year gas supply agreement with Venezuela. The United States is deploying drones to strike ELN guerrilla elements and is reportedly considering a strike on ELN forces operating inside Venezuela. Two battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPQ0dCaWVmOUV0SExGR1lQTVEzY1UxWXhnM0RYcUlQdVdRQ3hYSm1kbW8zbWhrUkNNVlA3WWxpRG5La1VwejZCOTNweHkweGJqRFB4c0pUU05STDVMV0RWRmRZcUxVYkR4RVg3Y1p4bHNwTi1YY1pKTmFkSFZhTXd2SExab0diU1ZRX3JnS3REcXlROWdhQkNrMXVmOGdCaE9QVnZYdWpUbkdIaWgz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOZGdiU2ZVSnJLeTFOaWM1XzhrV1djU3Nzclp0SWxMcllQY2lHaFFlMmlSM3pqU0xzT1NkNXY4Sy13eFNXMDBheDVCTUxOVk8zM2hMcktockVyZjNJUUIyejJCRkJFNTROUXo4Rkp3NUpVNWFUaHBMNEtDaXc3NHE3OVlzWTN2cUQyTi12V3RHeUs0aTFhUjQ2V0p3Q3JlRngzTjctOEtWZGVqZnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPbGxKM3R5T09iSmZXc3lMMVB5NGJ1c05VYkY4V3ZMWDJPTTIzdDBTNUpmN2VDZVpVWTJibkVjVE5xN0tmYmM3a1JUTy1sdlhCNm5TcGFaSEpiTlhIWVR0WDY3dWZsTVM0em80NFVOdnlKdGsyWDV4R2ZaZTkzSFNjUDBZZ3doYl91RW0tMjViYkw3bFdHTTE4ZW52WTY1Wk1lX3hjVHVhdGdNcVpvekVfcll3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPYzF4ZV85dk4wQmdmaGZ5UWFSajhKVXZaN0tOb3hQMFZTYTdkUDFRRWtZWVNkWGt4S0w5X0t3RzBYbWVCcEQzNjc3bFFDOGRxZkxzbE15QlVIQU02V1drbXk4Ym9UemkwNE5MWWN0VTFvdmd2RjQ5R3pjTWhUeDBtdVRGQkF2MlpFV1BzUFdyZF9BOGlhY